81","id":3921702289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pwG2R","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T16:08:08Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T16:08:08Z","body":"Found some issues that I'm not sure if they are platform specific (Fedora GNU/Linux):\r\n\r\nIn X11:\r\n- Trying to open dock menu via the 3-dots button on a floating window results in it closing immediately after.\r\n- - Clicking the floating window after that makes the main window be focused instead.\r\n\r\nIn Wayland:\r\n- The dock menu is opened relative to the main window, instead of the floating one.\r\n- Dragging a tab from/to a floating window makes it be stuck in the slot highlight state.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3921702289/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3921774371","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114381#issuecomment-3921774371","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114381","id":3921774371,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pwYcj","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T16:21:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T11:08:42Z","body":"> The dock menu is opened relative to the main window, instead of the floating one.\r\n\r\nThis bug also exists on Windows. It also exist in the current docks, but you need to have a window spanning between screens to reproduce it. I forgot to open an issue about it.\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\n> Dragging a tab from/to a floating window makes it be stuck in the slot highlight state.\r\n\r\n#116577 might be related.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3921774371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4165841860","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114381#